<title>UK: Cox Insurance buys Sphere Drake business.</title>
<headline>Cox Insurance buys Sphere Drake business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cox Insurance Holdings Plc said on Thursday that a Lloyd's syndicate under its management bought a specialist yacht and cargo business from Sphere Drake for 900,000 stg cash.</p>
<p>The company said Syndicate 590/2591 bought Groves, John &amp; Westrup Underwriting Ltd, which was expected to generate premium income of about 10 million stg in 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
